# CODEOWNERS — automatic reviewer assignment by path.
#
# Today the project is solo-maintained, so this file lists
# one GitHub handle per line. When more maintainers join,
# this file gets @-prefixed GitHub teams (e.g. @cardscape/mcp-maintainers).
# See docs/community/MAINTAINERS.md for the maintainer-team model.
#
# Order matters: the last matching rule wins. The most
# specific rule should be the last one for a given path.

# Default owner: the project maintainer.
